<title>SLOVENIA: Slovenia July trade deficit narrows to $48.5 mln.</title>
<headline>Slovenia July trade deficit narrows to $48.5 mln.</headline>
<dateline>LJUBLJANA 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Statistical Office of Slovenia reported the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p>SLOVENIA TRADE (in millions of dollars)</p>
<p>				July  June     July 1995</p>
<p>    trade balance	-48.5  -105.6   -115.2</p>
<p>    exports		733.5   657.3    727.7</p>
<p>    imports		782.0   762.9    842.9</p>
<p>-- Marja Novak, Ljubljana newsroom, 386-61-125-8439</p>
</text>
